{"id":"646263","name":"酱拌小青虾","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/646263/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青虾","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"5-6瓣"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"1-2颗"},{"name":"高度白酒","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小青虾洗干净。","img":"images/646263/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"反复清洗。","img":"images/646263/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"控水。","img":"images/646263/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备葱姜蒜香菜。","img":"images/646263/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切成末。","img":"images/646263/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入高度白酒，2勺左右。","img":"images/646263/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"料酒1勺。","img":"images/646263/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"酱油1勺，海鲜酱油。","img":"images/646263/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"醋，半勺。","img":"images/646263/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盐，1匙。","img":"images/646263/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"糖，1匙。","img":"images/646263/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"花椒大料适量。","img":"images/646263/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"麻油适量。","img":"images/646263/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"葱姜蒜香菜切末倒入。","img":"images/646263/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"辣根用酱油稀释调匀。","img":"images/646263/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"拌均匀。","img":"images/646263/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放在冰箱冰镇半个小时。","img":"images/646263/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"酱拌小青虾。","img":"images/646263/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}